    "title": "Moreau woman charged with pushing child down staircase - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Daniel Duric ,\n1 hours ago MOREAU — The Saratoga County Sheriff’s Office arrested a 26-year-old woman Tuesday on charges she intentionally pushed a child under 7 years old down a staircase. Jordyn A. Mullarkey of Moreau was charged with second-degree assault, a class D felony, and endangering the welfare of a child, a class A misdemeanor. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
